<title>AUSTRALIA: NAB appoints exec to Michigan National.</title>
<headline>NAB appoints exec to Michigan National.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Australia Bank Ltd said on Monday that it appointed Wayne Rees as chief operating officer of its Michigan National Bank unit in the United States, effective next month.</p>
<p>Rees was previously head of NAB's premier financial services division based in Sydney.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
